    return vec3(pos.xy / factor, pos.z * 0.2);
  配合 git 6fcb0fd:Astra/shaders/lib/settings.glsl:  #define SHADOW_DISTANCE 128
    → shadow_map_bias = 1 - 25.6/128 = 0.8  →  factor = 0.8*M + 0.2   （= :59 的 .2+.8*m ✓）
